When I see you uploading your pictures, it makes me happy. Thank you very much.\nI am sending you a request to draw my original character this time.\n\n──────────────────\n\nBrother\nName: Seiichiro Mimatani\nAge: 18, 177cm\nPersonality: Quiet and calm, not the type to talk much\nHobbies: Reading books\nFighting Style: Mainly uses knives, not good with guns psychologically\n\nThe eldest son born into a family of hit men. Although he is skilled, he does not like killing or hurting people very much. Therefore, he does not like his parents, who are trained to follow in his footsteps. He cares about his younger sister.\n\n［Past History.]\nHe decided to become a hitman after his family was killed when he was a child. His goal is to find out who killed his family and kill them. He only does the minimum amount of killing necessary, even when he is asked to do so.\n\nSister\nName: Kazuki Mimatani\n15 years old, 157cm\nPersonality: cheerful, friendly, and cruel by any means necessary to achieve her goals.\nHobby: Collecting knives\nFighting Style: Mainly uses two guns, sometimes knives\n\nHe was raised in a family of hit men, but was adopted by a yakuza (gangster) family. His goal is to meet his own brother, and he plans to become the head of his adopted family in order to gather information. Since his brother was unwilling to kill, his sister, who is willing to kill, promised to take his place. She likes her brother's knife-handling skills.\n\n［A Synopsis of the Past.]\nHis sister was attacked when she was young, her parents were killed, and she was kidnapped. Since she was so young, she was taken and raised in the same house where she was kidnapped for the purpose of using her as a human resource. She uses everything to meet her brother.\n\n［Their relationship.]\nThey care for each other.\n\n[Ref.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/15QBoEIeIGdjuDqg2_iZ_71tw9ny2Aa86\n\n\n─────────────────\n\nIf you don't mind, I would appreciate it if you could draw the composition as if the two of them are killing or fighting each other. Thank you very much.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c7031c0e/uploads/origins/6c4a4f05-6201-4cd7-8b99-bb1f53a4e614?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1cf4b729d7b2573a45b713e5c4553226", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c7031c0e/uploads/origins/6c4a4f05-6201-4cd7-8b99-bb1f53a4e614?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=1cf4b729d7b2573a45b713e5c4553226, https://si.imgix.net/c7031c0e/uploads/origins/6c4a4f05-6201-4cd7-8b99-bb1f53a4e614?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=14f0a9cfa0d2fdee856bbedebfb9bc8f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c7031c0e/uploads/origins/6c4a4f05-6201-4cd7-8b99-bb1f53a4e614?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=7757e0a215f6da34859b5f7a03852f5c 3x"}, "private": true, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2307641, "nc": 1}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2307641, "client_id": 2056357, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc86731506c33abbe6fe691a80bde045", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dc86731506c33abbe6fe691a80bde045, https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=46e62f78e8a3f2203b32708b804d189e 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4689906b80c8752292f6cc55a24c2895 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1680f6af6a8a4a1680a7e0af011ddfb7", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1680f6af6a8a4a1680a7e0af011ddfb7, https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=1faebfe872fd602372068cd38c3e88f2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/04fc7bc8/uploads/origins/a1bd94cd-b652-4683-b72a-c7967c9b9242?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b010ec4f144e9e39f0efc8b55f31cb8c 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは、先生の作品がとても好きです。私と友達のオリジナルキャラクターのイラストを頼みたいのですが、よろしいでしょうか。\n\nピンクの髪は、女装してる男子高校生です。\n\n白髪は、JKの格好をしてる社会人です。\n\n二人は、普段一緒に超自然現象を調査して、その中で報酬を受けてお金を稼いでいます。\n\n構図、ポーズ等について先生の好きなように、お任せします。\n\nまた、もし練習絵や習作などがあれば、保留してもらえないでしょうか。なくても大丈夫です。\n\nイラストの完成を心より楽しみにしています。何卒よろしくお願いいたします。\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1mvq85yRqgwotzO5G7ZGLxWawq425kzFr?usp=share_link", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2307641, "client_id": 2537348, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ca967cb3bd63fd65d826130251d78e3", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4ca967cb3bd63fd65d826130251d78e3, https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=786a966a1f0046039e36c4f49ecf9e88 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=50edd468397f334023b8925c7ee75182 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f0c23422a7db71fc9e77c6276e6a984", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9f0c23422a7db71fc9e77c6276e6a984, https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=d10d103a80d2200227963611291e58bd 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d61f7735/uploads/origins/76a83240-96fa-45e3-9a9a-60f0a011b404?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=e444bfa23dd594fe38a65f5854ff3d82 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, please excuse my sudden message. I really like @'s wonderful drawings and would like you to draw two of my original characters for me.\nPlease see the attached link as a reference for the setting.\nPlease feel free to leave the composition, pose, background, etc. to us. Best regards.\n\nhttps://twitter.com/gohan_three/status/1605490349488492544?s=20&t=kpKyn0qN-agiMTAMT0AeZA", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/7", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2307641, "client_id": 1179131, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e369339716accebb6926b3cb2b6b106", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0e369339716accebb6926b3cb2b6b106, https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7323c6d3fcf28bb486000f8372c98f41 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=edc5634822ae12820ca88facf237b39e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27a5c5ec1393c2d50a969c52f19b22b4", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27a5c5ec1393c2d50a969c52f19b22b4, https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0a2ecc2374330053e2d7de9725d387e7 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4a45af37/uploads/origins/60e86034-2064-4043-b7e0-5deaf29668fc?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6d19183fab7e18883872d4a3619e0ebc 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you, sensei's works are super amazing! Could you please draw my OCs?\nPlease draw them in 2020s paro, and feel free to change their clothings. Please let ネイサン wear glasses, and you don't have to make ソレル's sideburns become white(which means all the hair is brown/ deep burgundy are fine!). \nAs long as they interact with each other, no matter at work or dating in leisure time, please feel free to choose the detailed scene!\nIf possible, please provide a psd file with your signature in another layer.\nThank you for your time reading my request! If you don’t like it, please feel free to cancel directly.\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1iK-3259QheyVHIvlZHr3BsU1vJ5qytsd?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2307641, "client_id": 1724300, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a51887a494095ae0f514fdbdd69d672c", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a51887a494095ae0f514fdbdd69d672c, https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6e6fef24451c060721a78610e44c5ad9 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=58a6818c1d34ac25323abe77f1a6e0ff 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08113ff4142db72d9d49870c3f833152", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=08113ff4142db72d9d49870c3f833152, https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=4f9e17c8a91d8eb1f301db2e75fa8b93 2x, https://si.imgix.net/5dc6b8fa/uploads/origins/1a3b7583-7d7b-4323-8202-db1103cf0b50?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8e39f3f8595f9fc22e82e9d1628a5c49 3x"}, "body": "Nice to meet you! My name is hiyoko.\nIf you don't mind, I would like to request the following two people!\nThey will be explorers from a CoC secret scenario, but there are no spoilers in the links!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1saZ1o1zjnUfPUyQAu3Bfj3Q-mJfLEc-j?usp=sharing\n\nAbout the above characters\nBoth are in their mid-twenties.\nHO1 has only roommate feelings for HO2, and HO2 has almost obsessive feelings for HO1. However, they both have quiet personalities, so I think it is difficult to show their attitudes.\nI'll leave it all up to you to decide on the composition.\n\nOther matters\nThe illustration may be used as a social networking icon.\n\nWe apologize for the length of this message.\nPlease take care of yourself as the weather is getting colder.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0b4554f/uploads/origins/af61a4c5-2