 certain Holy Grail War for the first time. The use of color is also wonderful and I always look at your drawings with a sense of gratitude. Thank you very much.\n\nI am very sorry for your busy schedule, but I would like to send you a request to draw our OC if you would like.\nWhat I would like you to draw is two OCs, myself and a friend.\nThese two are colleagues who work for the city hall.\n\nSenior, male\n26 years old\nHe is 178cm tall.\nHe is basically a clumsy character who does not assert himself very much.\nHe wants to help all those who are in trouble in front of him and wants them to depend on him.\nHe is actually quite concerned about his juniors.\nKeywords: fire, flame, two-faced, altruistic, first love\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/11BVSArH7rHXn8y11U5R9XiwxTUxseL9C?usp=sharing\n\nJunior, female\nAge: 23\nShe is 23 years old and 165cm tall.\nShe does not show much emotion in her facial expression and attitude, and cannot express her feelings well.\nShe actually worships her seniors.\nKeywords: flower hairpin, inorganic, strong\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1uuX4MwUZUiCfHH39mNLU7xa-p8QBKPaW?usp=sharing\n\nThey both fight. The senior (male) is two-fisted and the junior (female) is kicking.\n\nTheir relationship: they care for each other, but both are too clumsy to communicate to the other at all. The feelings they hold for each other are not romantic love.\n\nThere are no specifications for poses or situations, so I would be very happy if you could draw them as you wish.\nI would appreciate your consideration.\nThank you very much.", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@OKbokujoq/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2307641, "client_id": 652091, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a5b1eb8f/uploads/origins/c042702e-290e-4a1c-aa3a-60ef874ef63f?bg=%23fff&auto=form