nAuthor not yet ready for publication.\n\nLink / 184cm\n[appearance reference] https://toyhou.se/16259452.link/gallery?key=WfkKf8sxQXkuS1G\nHe is always irritated, but he doesn't show it.\nHe changes his personality to suit other people.\nHe is a back street doctor and used to be in the military.\n\nRelationships\nChildhood friend, acts like an ex-lover.\nThey have no romantic feelings for each other, but they are dating in a different distant world line.\nHeise tends to irritate Link.\n\nOutline\nYou can design and dress her in any outfit you like!\nIt doesn't matter if the hair is long or short.\nYou can use \"stories, art galleries, movie theaters, azure skies, waterfront suicides\" as motifs.\nYou can use any of these motifs.\n\nIf the amount is not enough, please appeal for an appropriate amount.\nYou can draw whatever you like! Your drawings are truly beautiful!\n\nhttps://sta.sh/28r9za3yw5x", "nc": 128, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}], "sent_works": [], "similar_creators": [{"id": 348612, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": false, "name": "あをいと :awoito:", "screen_name": "B3jD3wDmUXfhNxF", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2004199660299399168/SDRrJppE.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1161848681416421377/1736339209/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "complete_expiration_days": 120, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "banned": false, "nc": 49}, {"id": 693924, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "がみー", "screen_name": "my11gum", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1555701840930832385/PtA1qzs1.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2164532954/1766905336/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, 